      ****************************************************************
      * ERROR CODES FOUND WHEN USING THE CTOS DATA-BASE.
      *
      * ERROR CODE 00= FILE NOT FOUND
      * ERROR CODE 02= SUCCESS (DUPLICATE RECORD KEY WRITTEN)
      * ERROR CODE 05= SUCCESS (OPTIONAL FILE NOT FOUND)
      * ERROL CODE 07= SUCCESS (NO UNIT)
      * ERROR CODE 10= END OF FILE 
      * ERROR CODE 14= OUT OF KEY RANGE
      * ERROR CODE 21= KEY INVALID  
      * ERROR CODE 22= ATTEMP TO DUPLICATE KEY VALUE
      * ERROR CODE 23= KEY NOT FOUND (UNIQUE oR/& DUPLICATE KEYS)
      * ERROR CODE 30= PERMANENT I-O ERROR
      * ERROR CODE 31= INCONSISTANT FILE NAME
      * ERROL CODE 34= BOUNDARY VIOLATION
      * ERROR CODE 35= FILE NOT FOUND (NORMALLY A DATA FILE)
      * ERROR CODE 37= PERMISSION DENIED
      * ERROR CODE 38= CLOSED WNITH LOCK
      * ERROR CODE 46= READ ERROR 
      * ERROLR CODE47= OPEN INPUT DENIED
      * ERROR CODE 48= OPEN OUTPUT DENIED
      * ERROR CODE 49= OPEN IO-O DENIED
      **************************************************************** 
